  "description": "In a world where magic and might clash, Isoc dreams of becoming a wizard despite his muscular build. Raised by Father Kay, a priest who insists he become a fighter, Isoc faces constant pressure to follow a path he doesn't desire.\n\nDesperate to pursue his magical aspirations, Isoc ventures into the treacherous Dark Forest. There, he's attacked and nearly killed by a curse-eaten monster. At the brink of death, he's saved by a mysterious figure known only as the Witch.\n\nHowever, salvation comes at a price. The Witch, seeing potential in Isoc, forcefully binds him into a magical contract. \"I'll give you a curse, so make a contract with me!\" she declares, insisting that Isoc now owes her his life.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://novelpia.com/comic_episode/635)",
